Subject: [PATCH 05/13] @ Phase 5-9: Complete Qwen3VL integration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 5: Vision attention kernel — uses existing flash_attention2_no_pad
Phase 6: Executor — add qwen3_vl model type, pass multimodal params
Phase 7: Generation pipeline (qwen3vl_generate_stream.py)
Phase 8: Weight conversion — reuses Qwen3 mapping (see docs)
Phase 9: CLI entry point (cli_qwen3vl.py)

Summary of all files added/modified:
- models/model_config.py: Qwen3VLVisionConfig, Qwen3VLConfig
- models/RotaryEmbedding.py: Qwen3VLTextRotaryEmbedding (M-RoPE)
- models/qwen3vl_vision.py: Full vision encoder (ViT, PatchMerger, DeepStack)
- models/qwen3vl.py: Qwen3VLModel wrapper
- models/qwen3.py: DeepStack support in Qwen3Model.forward()
- executor/model_executor.py: qwen3_vl model type
- executor/executor_struct.py: CONFIG_CLASS_MAP entry
- qwen3vl_generate_stream.py: Streaming generation
- cli_qwen3vl.py: Interactive CLI
- docs/qwen3vl_support_plan.md: Implementation plan document

